The tester's 56332: three runs asked where a contact works through
search_contact_by_name alone. likely_employer and its note ride only with
get_contact_full_profile, so the note never reached them, and one English
answer said the label's company word as certain („saved in your contacts as
working at PwC"). The name search now adds likely_employer to each of its
first three rows that have no employer of their own, and the same approved
note once for the result. The note's text is unchanged word for word.
LIKELY_EMPLOYER_ON=false switches both places off.

